# 03_imprint_hex.jou — multi-body CAD with shared topology + hex mesh
# Expected: DO NOT translate. This file uses imprint/merge + hex sweep +
# block tagging, none of which have a build123d equivalent. Should be
# kept as-is for Cubit → hex → Radia/ELF.
reset

# Iron core with a coil window
create brick x 50 y 50 z 20
create brick x 30 y 30 z 20
subtract volume 2 from volume 1 keep

# Copper winding inside the window
create brick x 28 y 28 z 18
move volume 3 x 0 y 0 z 0

# Shared-topology union: imprint+merge is mandatory for conformal hex
imprint all
merge all

# Hex mesh via sweep scheme, uniform size
volume all scheme sweep
volume all size 2
mesh volume all

# Block registration for the NGSolve/Radia pipeline
block 1 volume 1 2 4
block 1 name "iron_core"
block 2 volume 3
block 2 name "winding"
